     3018   PROCEDURE enable_UI :
     3019     DISPLAY sch-code sch-date mark-num
     3020         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     3021     ENABLE b-quit b-mark b-sel b-chk-doc b-lnk b-sch B-Help br-trans sch-code
     3022            sch-date mark-num
